    <header class="post__header">
        <h1>How to Choose a Flower Shop POS in UAE: 7 Things Florists Should Check</h1>
        <div class="post__meta">By <a href="{{ $base }}/author/multitech_admin/">multitech_admin</a> / July 28, 2026</div>
