        <td><strong>#</strong></td><td><strong>What to Check</strong></td><td><strong>Why It Matters for Florists</strong></td></tr>
        <tr>
        <td>1</td><td>Perishable inventory tracking</td><td>Wastage is the biggest hidden cost in floral retail</td></tr>
        <tr>
        <td>2</td><td>Pre-orders, deposits &amp; event scheduling</td><td>Weddings and events are your highest-ticket revenue</td></tr>
        <tr>
        <td>3</td><td>FTA-compliant VAT invoicing</td><td>Non-compliant invoices risk fines and failed audits</td></tr>
        <tr>
        <td>4</td><td>Delivery management</td><td>Late or lost deliveries destroy repeat business</td></tr>
        <tr>
        <td>5</td><td>Bouquet recipes &amp; bundle billing</td><td>Arrangements are made of components, not single SKUs</td></tr>
